  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ecociencia - Indigenous people and civil society taking action to protect the Amazon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project&#x2019;s impact goal is to avoid and reverse deforestation and degradation in the Ecuadorian Amazon, while guaranteeing the rights and sustainable livelihoods of indigenous peoples and local communities, through natural climate solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
